  },
  "compute_note": "Both arms use the same Hegel search-operation unit. Report per-sequence and per-stage success, observation, measurement, compute, query and cumulative learning wall separately. Cumulative learning wall sums independent sequence work durations and is not concurrent campaign elapsed time. Terminal costs stay separate. Comparison indexes reference reports rather than copying sessions.",
  "advice_alignment": {
