    "target": "Discover an executable candidate from composed relation and comparison syntax, seek distinguishing evidence, revise the affected relationship inside an existing composition, then reuse it under renamed measurements and return to earlier knowledge.",
    "claim_scope": "A bounded family on the existing public object schema; this protocol alone does not establish open-world discovery or stable general-purpose long-term benefit."
